{"id": "EUVD-2026-76595", "enisaUuid": "ad977953-10f2-3a6b-be89-106e68308fc7", "description": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nnfsd: fix dentry ref leak on V4ROOT export filehandle lookup\n\nnfsd_set_fh_dentry() leaks the dentry reference from\nexportfs_decode_fh_raw() when the NFS3_FHSIZE or NFS_FHSIZE\nswitch cases detect NFSEXP_V4ROOT and goto out. The out: label\ncalls exp_put() but never dput(dentry), and fhp->fh_dentry was\nnever assigned so fh_put() cannot compensate.\n\nA crafted NFSv3 filehandle targeting a V4ROOT export's fsid\ntriggers the leak on every request.", "datePublished": "2026-09-11T19:46:05", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-19T08:50:56", "baseScore": 0.0, "references": ["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/d493cf57f4c4dae5396cd6ad41e5c209d0615a81", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/c1ae0f973bcba5730871e35976a0ab6878fdac34", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/11db8df188b34bdb8c6a3a0bf438e5fc8cd75aca", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/6247023fbbec1325029f2d5f2a7cdc0f9f9ea15a"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-89683", "GHSA-58hv-jwv2-hff3"], "assigner": "Linux", "epss": 0.18, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "0b8de570-c0ae-3125-bddf-6c5f02b0e49e", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "ef7f6c4904d03ccd7478e1ac20ed75f79c4ac444 <d493cf57f4c4dae5396cd6ad41e5c209d0615a81"}, {"id": "43dd9111-372b-3bbb-8ee9-1507f37ed2fb", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "ef7f6c4904d03ccd7478e1ac20ed75f79c4ac444 <6247023fbbec1325029f2d5f2a7cdc0f9f9ea15a"}, {"id": "6b41b073-6cd1-373e-b248-ff303252011c", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "ef7f6c4904d03ccd7478e1ac20ed75f79c4ac444 <11db8df188b34bdb8c6a3a0bf438e5fc8cd75aca"}, {"id": "6f4a4281-a589-39e3-8d85-2f2298a703d0", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "ef7f6c4904d03ccd7478e1ac20ed75f79c4ac444 <c1ae0f973bcba5730871e35976a0ab6878fdac34"}, {"id": 